(0.2.8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: Xray-core and sing-box engines, two ranking modes
    (ping-style and EWMA + Thompson sampling) with configurable weights,
    VLESS/Reality, VMess, Trojan, Shadowsocks and SOCKS import, subscription
    URLs with quota headers, per-profile routing and DNS, system-proxy
    takeover with snapshot/restore, kill switch, and a self-updating
    `release` manifest with sha256 verification.
  * Packages are produced by .github/workflows/release.yml from the tagged
    commit; this changelog is the source-build record for dpkg-buildpackage.

 -- Naxlo <packaging@naxlo.dev>  Sat, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0330
